<% hero = scene.active_player %><% game = scene.game_session %>Scene <%= scene.position %> of <%= game.scene_budget %>, <%= scene.part_of_the_story %>, <%= hero.name %>'s turn.<% unless scene.first? %> Pick up where the last outcome stopped, without retelling it. The heroes do only what the players chose: where the way forks, the fork goes into the choices.<% end %><% if scene.last? %> Bring the story to the moment that decides it: the roll on the choice made here ends it.<% end %>
<%= hero.name %>, <%= hero.character.identity %>: <%= hero.character.sheet %>.
<% if (companions = scene.companions).any? %>In the scene with <%= hero.name %>: <%= companions.map { it.character.portrait }.join("; ") %>.
<% end %>